# StellarMasses
# StellarMasses
# v19
# 2016-09-27
# Edward Taylor <entaylor@swin.edu.au>
#
# This table provides stellar masses, restframe photometry, and other
# ancillary stellar population parameters from stellar population fits
# to restframe u-Y SEDs (using aperture-matched photometry) for all
# GAMA DR3 galaxies with z < 0.65 galaxies in the equatorial survey
# regions.
#
CATAID             1  -                 meta.id;meta.main                Unique ID of GAMA object
Z                  2  -                 src.redshift                     Heliocentric redshift
nQ                 3  -                 meta.code.qual;src.redshift      Normalised redshift quality (use nQ > 2 for science)
SURVEY_CODE        4  -                 meta.code;meta.dataset           Redshift source flag (GAMA=5; SDSS=1)
SURVEY_CLASS       5  -                 meta.code;meta.dataset           Target selection flag (>=3 for main survey targets)
Z_TONRY            6  -                 src.redshift                     Flow corrected redshift using Tonry et al. model
fluxscale          7  -                 arith.factor                     Aperture correction factor for scaling total luminosities and stellar masses, see notes
zmax_19p8          8  -                 src.redshift;stat.max            Maximum redshift for which r_petro <= 19.8 (GAMA II SURVEY_CLASS >= 4 selection)
zmax_19p4          9  -                 src.redshift;stat.max            Maximum redshift for which r_petro <= 19.4 (GAMA I G09/G15 SURVEY_CLASS >= 6 selection)
zmax_19p0         10  -                 src.redshift;stat.max            Maximum redshift for which r_petro <= 19.0 (DR2 G09/G12 selection)
zmax_17p8         11  -                 src.redshift;stat.max            Maximum redshift for which r_petro <= 17.8 (SDSS main survey selection)
nbands            12  -                 meta.number                      Effective no. of bands used in the fit (treat < 3.5 with caution)
S2N               13  -                 meta.number                      Net effective signal-to-noise in the fit-to SED
PPP               14  -                 meta.number                      Posterior Predictive P-Value Goodness of Fit metric (treat PPP < ~0.2 with caution; PPP ~ 0 implies a bad fit)
logmstar          15  dex(Msun)         phys.mass                        Stellar mass within the photometric aperture, see notes 
dellogmstar       16  dex(Msun)         stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logmstar
logmoverl_i       17  dex(Msun/Lsun,i)  phys.composition.massLightRatio  Mass-to-light ratio (restframe i-band)
dellogmoverl_i    18  dex(Msun/Lsun,i)  stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logmoverl_i
logage            19  dex(yr)           time.age                         SPS age T = t(z_obs) - t(z_form)
dellogage         20  dex(yr)           stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logage
logtau            21  dex(yr)           time.scale                       SPS e-folding time for the exponentially declining SFH
dellogtau         22  dex(yr)           stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logtau
logmintsfh        23  dex(Msun)         phys.mass                        Implied mass obtained by integrating over the SFH up to the point of observation, see notes
dellogmintsfh     24  dex(Msun)         stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logmintsfh
logmremnants      25  dex(Msun)         phys.mass                        Implied mass in non-luminous stellar remnants within the auto aperture, see notes
dellogmremnants   26  dex(Msun)         stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logmremnants
metal             27  -                 phys.abund.Z                     SPS stellar metallicity (Z_Sol = 0.02)
delmetal          28  -                 stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on metal
extBV             29  mag               phys.absorption                  SPS dust obscuration; for Calzetti et al. (2003) dust A_V = 3.1 x E(B-V)
delextBV          30  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on extBV
logLWage          31  dex(yr)           time.age                         Restframe i-band luminosity weighted mean stellar age
dellogLWage       32  dex(yr)           stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on logLWage
gminusi           33  mag               phot.color                       Restframe (g-i) colour from SED fit
delgminusi        34  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on gminusi
uminusr           35  mag               phot.color                       Restframe (u-r) colour from SED fit
deluminusr        36  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty on uminusr
gminusi_stars     37  mag               phot.color                       Intrinsic, stellar (g-i) colour from SED fit, i.e. corrected for internal dust obscuration
uminusr_stars     38  mag               phot.color                       Intrinsic, stellar (u-r) colour from SED fit, i.e. corrected for internal dust obscuration
C_logM_ur         39  -                 stat.correlation                 Correlation coefficient between logmstar and uminusi for covariant error matrix
C_logM_gi         40  -                 stat.correlation                 Correlation coefficient between logmstar and gminusi for covariant error matrix
C_logM_eBV        41  -                 stat.correlation                 Correlation coefficient between logmstar and extBV for covariant error matrix
fitphot_u         42  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame u-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits (likely extrapolated; see notes)
delfitphot_u      43  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_u
absmag_u          44  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe u-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_u       45  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_u
absmag_u_stars    46  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe u-band
fitphot_g         47  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame g-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_g      48  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_g
absmag_g          49  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe g-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_g       50  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_g
absmag_g_stars    51  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe g-band
fitphot_r         52  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame r-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_r      53  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_r
absmag_r          54  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe r-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_r       55  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_r
absmag_r_stars    56  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe r-band
fitphot_i         57  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame i-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_i      58  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_i
absmag_i          59  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe i-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_i       60  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_i
absmag_i_stars    61  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe i-band
fitphot_z         62  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame z-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_z      63  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_z
absmag_z          64  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe z-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_z       65  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_z
absmag_z_stars    66  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe z-band
fitphot_X         67  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame (VISTA) Z-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_X      68  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_X
absmag_X          69  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe (VISTA) Z-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_X       70  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_X
absmag_X_stars    71  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe (VISTA) Z-band
fitphot_Y         72  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame Y-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_Y      73  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_Y
absmag_Y          74  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe Y-band from SPS SED fits
delabsmag_Y       75  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_Y
absmag_Y_stars    76  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission (i.e. corrected for internal dust extinction) in restframe Y-band
fitphot_J         77  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame J-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits
delfitphot_J      78  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_J
absmag_J          79  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe J-band from SPS SED fits (extrapolated; see notes)
delabsmag_J       80  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_J
absmag_J_stars    81  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission in restframe J-band (extrapolated; see notes)
fitphot_H         82  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame H-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits (likely extrapolated; see notes)
delfitphot_H      83  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_H 
absmag_H          84  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe H-band from SPS SED fits (extrapolated; see notes)
delabsmag_H       85  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_H
absmag_H_stars    86  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission in restframe H-band (extrapolated; see notes)
fitphot_K         87  mag               phot.mag                         Best-fit observers' frame K-band apparent magnitude from SPS SED fits (likely extrapolated; see notes)
delfitphot_K      88  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in fitphot_K
absmag_K          89  mag               phys.magAbs                      Absolute magnitude in restframe K-band from SPS SED fits (extrapolated; see notes)
delabsmag_K       90  mag               stat.error                       Formal uncertainty in absmag_K
absmag_K_stars    91  mag               phys.magAbs                      Intrinsic abs. mag. of all stellar emission in restframe K-band (extrapolated; see notes)
URL_PNG           92  -                 meta.ref.url;meta.file           URL of summary plot
